--- !u!1001 &53531635
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1767004675}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 15
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: appearanceAtQuest
      value: 25
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "No to o\u015Bwie\u0107 nas, co to za plan. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Stachu, zdarza\u0142o ci si\u0119 otwiera\u0107 zatrza\u015Bni\u0119te
        zamki, nie? Dasz rad\u0119 si\u0119 tu w\u0142ama\u0107? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "Hmm... b\u0119dzie problem. Zwyk\u0142y zamek to chwila roboty, ale
        ten jest elektryczny, raczej nie da rady bez narz\u0119dzi. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "Te drzwi nie wygl\u0105daj\u0105 na zbyt mocne, mo\u017Ce by je po
        prostu... wywa\u017Cy\u0107? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4]
      value: "I zwr\xF3ci\u0107 przy tym uwag\u0119 ca\u0142ej szko\u0142y? Nie,
        dzi\u0119ki. Mo\u017Ce damy rad\u0119 jako\u015B rozkr\u0119ci\u0107 ten
        zamek? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[5]
      value: "Nosisz przy sobie podr\u0119czny zestaw do rozkr\u0119cania zamk\xF3w? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[6]
      value: "A mo\u017Ce po prostu od\u0142\u0105czymy pr\u0105d? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[7]
      value: "Je\u015Bli wywa\u017Cenie drzwi mia\u0142o zwr\xF3ci\u0107 uwag\u0119
        ca\u0142ej szko\u0142y, to odci\u0119cie pr\u0105du nie wydaje si\u0119 lepszym
        pomys\u0142em."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[8]
      value: "Dlaczego nie? Je\u015Bli znale\u017Aliby\u015Bmy dobry moment... ma\u0142o
        kto zorientowa\u0142by si\u0119, \u017Ce to my. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[9]
      value: "Dobra, jaki\u015B pomys\u0142 od czego zacz\u0105\u0107? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: disappearanceAtQuest
      value: 26
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionSavesGame
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[10]
      value: "No, trzeba znale\u017A\u0107 plany instalacji elektrycznej, dowiedzie\u0107
        si\u0119, gdzie s\u0105 korki. Jakie\u015B pomys\u0142y, gdzie mog\u0105
        by\u0107? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[11]
      value: "Kojarzycie to miejsce przy szatni od WF-u? Raz te drzwi by\u0142y otwarte
        i wydaje mi si\u0119, \u017Ce widzia\u0142em tam jaki\u015B skrawek planu
        budynku czy czego\u015B w tym stylu. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[12]
      value: "My\u015Blisz, \u017Ce to mog\u0142o by\u0107 to? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[13]
      value: "Nie bez powodu te drzwi praktycznie zawsze s\u0105 zamkni\u0119te.
        Pewnie jest tam co\u015B wa\u017Cnego. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[14]
      value: "No to nie ma na co czeka\u0107, chod\u017Amy."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: voiceLines.Array.size
      value: 15
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
