    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[0]
      value: Emm...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[1]
      value: Tak?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[2]
      value: Przepraszam, czy Pani to...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[3]
      value: "Tak, to ja. Maryla Rodowicz. Gwiazda polskiej muzyki lat 70., 80.,
        90. i wielu innych dekad... i wiek\xF3w."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[4]
      value: "No prosz\u0119, prosz\u0119, szko\u0142a nie pr\xF3\u017Cnowa\u0142a.
        Przewodnicz\u0105cy musia\u0142 si\u0119 nie\u017Ale wykosztowa\u0107."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[5]
      value: "Powiem Ci s\u0142o\u0144ce, \u017Ce nie\u017Ale zap\u0142acili. Tylko
        jak co\u015B, to niczego nie wiesz..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[6]
      value: "Oczywi\u015Bcie, buzia na k\u0142\xF3dk\u0119."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[7]
      value: "Zaoferowali mi 10 tysi\u0119cy na czysto. Przyznam, \u017Ce warto by\u0142o
        wcze\u015Bniej si\u0119 odmrozi\u0107."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[8]
      value: "Faktycznie, niez\u0142a sumka. Czy potrzebuje Pani czego\u015B?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[9]
      value: "Nie, dzi\u0119kuj\u0119 z\u0142ociutka. Wod\u0119 z lodem jeszcze mam."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[10]
      value: 'Super, to nie przeszkadzam Pani. Do zobaczenia.  '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
