      propertyPath: m_SpriteTilingProperty.oldSize.x
      value: 0.19
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 94836419622286473, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SpriteTilingProperty.oldSize.y
      value: 0.34
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: appearanceAtQuest
      value: 39
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: disappearanceAtQuest
      value: 100
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionSavesGame
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.size
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionProgressesStory
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Dzie\u0144 dobry!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[1]
      value: "O, dzie\u0144 dobry, Igor."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[2]
      value: "Wod\u0119 poprosz\u0119. Co tu tak pusto?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[3]
      value: "Dobre pytanie. Kiedy\u015B mia\u0142am kolejki a\u017C poza akwarium,
        a teraz ma\u0142o kogo tu widuj\u0119. Co przerw\u0119 widz\u0119 ca\u0142\u0105
        chmar\u0119 dzieciak\xF3w wychodz\u0105cych ze szko\u0142y, a potem wracaj\u0105
        z hot-dogami, zapiekankami... Klienci uciekaj\u0105 mi do sklepiku niedaleko.
        Moje tosty przestaj\u0105 dor\xF3wnywa\u0107 konkurencji, a to na nich mia\u0142am
        najwi\u0119kszy utarg."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[4]
      value: "Pr\xF3bowa\u0142a Pani co\u015B z tym zrobi\u0107?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[5]
      value: "Oczywi\u015Bcie, obni\u017Ca\u0142am ceny, ale nie jestem w stanie
        opu\u015Bci\u0107 ich bardziej. Ju\u017C teraz ledwo si\u0119 trzymam, a
        wszystko dro\u017Ceje. Nied\u0142ugo pewnie p\xF3jd\u0119 z torbami. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[6]
      value: Bez przesady, poradzi Pani sobie.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[7]
      value: "Chcia\u0142abym. Ech, gdybym mog\u0142a jako\u015B inaczej ich wszystkich
        przyci\u0105gn\u0105\u0107. Nie wiem, na przyk\u0142ad stworzy\u0107 co\u015B
        nowego..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[8]
      value: "Hmpf... co, jakiego\u015B SuperTosta?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[9]
      value: "Tak, TAK! SUPERTOST! TO JEST MY\u015AL!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[10]
      value: "Znaczy... nie m\xF3wi\u0142em na ser..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[11]
      value: "Specjalne sk\u0142adniki, nie to co mia\u0142am do tej pory. Pieczywo,
        szynka i ser. Wszystko musi by\u0107 odpowiednio dobrane, najwy\u017Cszej
        jako\u015Bci. Igor? Musisz mi pom\xF3c."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[12]
      value: Ale...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[13]
      value: "Wiem, \u017Ce jeste\u015B dobry ch\u0142opak. Pom\xF3\u017C mi z tym,
        obiecuj\u0119, \u017Ce b\u0119dzie Ci si\u0119 to op\u0142aca\u0142o."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[14]
      value: "Dobrze, ale musz\u0119 ju\u017C i\u015B\u0107 na lekcje."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[15]
      value: "Id\u017A, nie zatrzymuj\u0119 ci\u0119 ju\u017C. Rozejrzyj si\u0119
        w wolnej chwili za sk\u0142adnikami, mo\u017Ce jakim\u015B cudem co\u015B
        znajdziesz. Tylko nie zapomnij!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[16]
      value: "Dobrze, dobrze. Nie zapomn\u0119."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[17]
      value: "Dobrze, dobrze. Nie zapomn\u0119."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[18]
      value: "Dobrze, dobrze. Nie zapomn\u0119."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[19]
      value: "Dobrze, dobrze. Nie zapomn\u0119."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
