    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: appearanceAtQuest
      value: 20
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: disappearanceAtQuest
      value: 99
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionSavesGame
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.size
      value: 17
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionProgressesStory
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Ooo... witajcie ch\u0142opcy."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Dzie\u0144 dobry."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[2]
      value: "Co tu robicie? Przecie\u017C z Wasz\u0105 grup\u0105 nie mam dzisiaj
        zaj\u0119\u0107."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[3]
      value: "Szukamy Kamila. Nie widzieli\u015Bmy go dzi\u015B jeszcze, szukali\u015Bmy
        go w jego biurze, teraz zaw\u0119drowali\u015Bmy tutaj. Nie wie pani, gdzie
        mo\u017Ce by\u0107?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[4]
      value: "Nie mam poj\u0119cia. Powinien by\u0107 tutaj, ale rano dyrektorka
        wys\u0142a\u0142a wiadomo\u015B\u0107 przez dziennik, \u017Ce Kamil ma dzisiaj
        by\u0107 zwolniony z zaj\u0119\u0107, bo jest jej potrzebny.  Nie poda\u0142a
        \u017Cadnych innych szczeg\xF3\u0142\xF3w."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[5]
      value: "No trudno, dzi\u0119kujemy Pani i tak."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[6]
      value: "Igor... zaczekaj chwileczk\u0119."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[7]
      value: Tak?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[8]
      value: "W listopadzie nie by\u0142o ci\u0119 na jednej z kartk\xF3wek..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[9]
      value: "Tak, by\u0142em chory. Mama napisa\u0142a mi przecie\u017C usprawiedliwienie."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[10]
      value: "Nie o to chodzi, musz\u0119 wystawi\u0107 oceny do ko\u0144ca tygodnia.
        I skoro ju\u017C tu jeste\u015B..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[11]
      value: "Prosz\u0119 Pani, czy nie mo\u017Ce to poczeka\u0107? Musimy teraz
        znale\u017A\u0107 Kamila."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[12]
      value: "Nie marud\u017A... B\u0119dzie \u0142atwe, zobaczysz. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[13]
      value: "Prosz\u0119 Pani, prosz\u0119. Kwa\u015Bny nam kaza\u0142."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[14]
      value: "Ehh, niech Ci b\u0119dzie. Masz szcz\u0119\u015Bcie, \u017Ce chodzi\u0142e\u015B
        mi na konkursy. Ustalimy to p\xF3\u017Aniej."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[15]
      value: "Dzi\u0119kuje Pani bardzo."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[16]
      value: Dobra, skoro Lidia nic nie wie na ten temat, to popytajmy dalej.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[17]
      value: "Ehh, niech Ci b\u0119dzie. Masz szcz\u0119\u015Bcie, \u017Ce chodzi\u0142e\u015B
        mi na konkursy. Ustalimy to p\xF3\u017Aniej."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[18]
      value: "Nie mam poj\u0119cia. Powinien by\u0107 tutaj, ale rano dyrektorka
        wys\u0142a\u0142a wiadomo\u015B\u0107 przez dziennik, \u017Ce Kamil ma dzisiaj
        by\u0107 zwolniony z zaj\u0119\u0107, bo jest jej potrzebny.  Nie poda\u0142a
        \u017Cadnych innych szczeg\xF3\u0142\xF3w."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
