--- !u!1001 &652660350
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1767004675}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.size
      value: 20
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[0]
      value: Siema.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Siema, zegarek Ci stan\u0105\u0142 czy co si\u0119 sta\u0142o?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[2]
      value: "Daj spok\xF3j, nas\u0142ucha\u0142em si\u0119 o SuperTo\u015Bcie."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[3]
      value: Hahaha, o czym?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[4]
      value: "Niewa\u017Cne, wyja\u015Bni\u0142bym Ci, ale sam te\u017C nie rozumiem."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[5]
      value: "Ej! Nie gada\u0107 mi tam, bo rozsadz\u0119. Welenc, powt\xF3rz, co
        powiedzia\u0142em przed chwil\u0105."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[6]
      value: Yyy...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[7]
      value: "No w\u0142a\u015Bnie. Dobra, jeszcze raz. Szyfr Cezara to szyfr, w
        kt\xF3rym ka\u017Cda z liter zamieniana jest na liter\u0119 oddalon\u0105
        od niej o pewn\u0105 sta\u0142\u0105 liczb\u0119. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[8]
      value: "Na przyk\u0142ad przy kluczu 3 oznacza\u0142oby to, \u017Ce przesuwamy
        ka\u017Cd\u0105 z liter o 3, w przypadku, kiedy dojdziemy do ko\u0144ca alfabetu,
        to zap\u0119tlamy to. I przypominam po raz kolejny, \u017Ce nie bierzemy
        pod uwag\u0119 polskich znak\xF3w."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[9]
      value: "We\u017Amy powiedzmy imi\u0119, Adam. Dla klucza 3 otrzymaliby\u015Bmy
        Dgdp, dla 5 by\u0142oby to Fifr. Kumaj\u0105? No, to do roboty."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightVoiceLines.Array.size
      value: 20
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: appearanceAtQuest
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0]
      value: Siema.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Siema, zegarek Ci stan\u0105\u0142 czy co si\u0119 sta\u0142o?"
