--- !u!1001 &754593754
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1767004675}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 14
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: appearanceAtQuest
      value: 73
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Chryste, co za mr\xF3z!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Stasiak, Welenc! Pom\xF3\u017Ccie mi wywa\u017Cy\u0107 te drzwi! Musimy
        wr\xF3ci\u0107 po Lor\u0119."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "Ro... Rogos. Nie mamy sza... szans. Musimy si\u0119 gdzie\u015B scho...
        schowa\u0107."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "Maja ma racj\u0119, zamarzniemy tu. Czuj\u0119, \u017Ce mi palce odmarzaj\u0105.
        Rogos, oni nas nie wpuszcz\u0105."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4]
      value: "Sami si\u0119 wpu\u015Bcimy i odbijemy Lor\u0119! Nie mo\u017Cemy jej
        tak zostawi\u0107."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[5]
      value: "Jako kostka lodu du\u017Co jej nie pomo\u017Cesz, a ja nie jestem Maryl\u0105
        Rodowicz, \u017Ceby da\u0107 si\u0119 zamrozi\u0107."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[6]
      value: "Ch\u0142opaki, ruszmy si\u0119 w ko\u0144cu."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[7]
      value: "W okolicy si\u0119 nigdzie nie rozgrzejemy... Chwila, a to co?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[8]
      value: Grzejnik? Co tu robi grzejnik?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[9]
      value: "Grzejnik? Moment, jeste\u015Bmy od strony parkingu. Kwa\u015Bny! Kwa\u015Bny
        przecie\u017C m\xF3wi\u0142, \u017Ce wyrzuci\u0142 grzejnik przez okno!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: disappearanceAtQuest
      value: 75
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionSavesGame
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[10]
      value: "My\u015Bla\u0142em, \u017Ce on \u017Cartowa\u0142..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[11]
      value: "Ja te\u017C, ale je\u015Bli mia\u0142bym kogo\u015B podejrzewa\u0107
        o faktyczne wywalenie grzejnika przez okno, to w\u0142a\u015Bnie Kwa\u015Bnego."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[12]
      value: "B\u0142agam Was! Pogadacie sobie p\xF3\u017Aniej, zr\xF3bmy co\u015B!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[13]
      value: "By\u0142a\u015B harcerk\u0105, po lasach spa\u0142a\u015B, szyszki
        jad\u0142a\u015B, prze\u017Cyjesz. Zobaczmy co z tym grzejnikiem, potem ogarniemy,
        jak wej\u015B\u0107 do budynku."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1192067823989137488, guid: 1e6228044f07561489cb3d68ad389e83, type: 3}
      propertyPath: voiceLines.Array.size
      value: 14
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
