--- !u!1001 &1206761772
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1767004675}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: appearanceAtQuest
      value: 15
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: disappearanceAtQuest
      value: 16
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionSavesGame
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionProgressesStory
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Hej, hej! Jak posz\u0142o?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Byli\u015Bmy w jego biurze... a raczej pod jego biurem. Drzwi by\u0142y
        zamkni\u0119te. Poszli\u015Bmy jeszcze zobaczy\u0107, czy nie ma go u Lidii,
        ale na pr\xF3\u017Cno. Wiemy jedynie tyle, \u017Ce Cary... to znaczy pani
        dyrektor zwolni\u0142a Kamila z ca\u0142ego dnia."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[2]
      value: "Bor\xF3wa podsun\u0105\u0142 nam jeszcze pomys\u0142, \u017Ce Kamil
        mo\u017Ce by\u0107 na koncercie. Wie Pan co\u015B o tym?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[3]
      value: "Tak. Szko\u0142a organizuje jaki\u015B koncert charytatywny, ale nie
        zag\u0142\u0119bia\u0142em si\u0119 w temat. Macie pewno\u015B\u0107, \u017Ce
        Kamil tam jest?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[4]
      value: "Nie, Bor\xF3wa tylko to przypuszcza\u0142. Wie tyle samo co my."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[5]
      value: "Sorry misie, ale nie ma co bazowa\u0107 na przypuszczeniach. Trzeba
        to zrobi\u0107 inaczej, musicie przeszuka\u0107 jego biuro. Przyda\u0142by
        si\u0119 te\u017C kto\u015B, kto b\u0119dzie szuka\u0142 Kamila gdzie\u015B
        tu w okolicy, jakby jednak si\u0119 pojawi\u0142. Id\u017Acie do sali Lidki,
        zbierzcie ekip\u0119 i do dzie\u0142a."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[6]
      value: "Ech... nie wiem jak Ty, ale ja b\u0119d\u0119 chcia\u0142 za to wy\u017Csz\u0105
        ocen\u0119 z infy. Od kogo zaczynamy?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[7]
      value: "Dawaj od \u015Awietlika."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[8]
      value: "Prowad\u017A, wodzu."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[9]
      value: "Prowad\u017A, wodzu."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[10]
      value: "Prowad\u017A, wodzu."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[11]
      value: "Burzy\u0144ski, jak to on. Oczywi\u015Bcie, \u017Ce co\u015B musia\u0142
        schrzani\u0107. Kto dopu\u015Bci\u0142 go na g\u0142ow\u0119 samorz\u0105du?!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[12]
      value: "Wy, dlatego teraz w imieniu wszystkich uczni\xF3w te\u017C zajmiecie
        si\u0119 tym problemem."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[13]
      value: "Ale to on schrzani\u0142, nie my. Brak wolnego po Nowym Roku... za
        takie co\u015B powinno si\u0119 i\u015B\u0107 siedzie\u0107."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[14]
      value: "A kto mia\u0142by go aresztowa\u0107? Mieli\u015Bmy dwa zamachy w tym
        mie\u015Bcie, a policja dalej siedzi cicho."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[15]
      value: "\u017Beby mieli si\u0119 za to zabra\u0107, musia\u0142by\u015B mie\u0107
        tyle kasy, \u017Ce wystarczy\u0142oby na zwyk\u0142e przekupienie Kamila
        i jeszcze troch\u0119 by zosta\u0142o."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[16]
      value: "Ech... a zapowiada\u0142 si\u0119 spokojny dzie\u0144. Co mamy zrobi\u0107?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[17]
      value: "Musicie rozezna\u0107 si\u0119 w sytuacji. Pogadajcie z Kamilem o tym,
        dlaczego nie ma wolnego. Id\u017Acie do dyrektorki i sami wywalczcie wolne,
        zr\xF3bcie z tym co\u015B."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[18]
      value: "W tej przerwie planowa\u0142em uczy\u0107 c\xF3rk\u0119 Pythona, bo
        ona akurat ma wolne, w przeciwie\u0144stwie do nas."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[19]
      value: "Pana c\xF3rka nie jest czasem gdzie\u015B we wczesnej podstaw\xF3wce?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[20]
      value: "Jest, a napisa\u0142aby matur\u0119 lepiej ni\u017C niejeden z Was.
        Mo\u017Cecie i\u015B\u0107, spr\xF3bujcie zacz\u0105\u0107 od Kamila, dyrektorka
        ulokowa\u0142a mu biuro niedaleko siebie, mo\u017Ce tam by\u0107."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[21]
      value: "Robi si\u0119."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightVoiceLines.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
