      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sideQuestId
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: appearanceAtQuest
      value: 51
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Ej, Mania si\u0119 odezwa\u0142a. Jest szansa na jakie\u015B cenne
        info z szatni s\u0119dzi\xF3w. Trzeba zrobi\u0107 akcj\u0119 dywersyjn\u0105"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Kamil, nie chcia\u0142by\u015B mo\u017Ce zabra\u0107 gdzie\u015B na
        chwil\u0119 tych s\u0119dzi\xF3w? Nie s\u0105 st\u0105d, pewnie pierwszy
        raz widz\u0105 t\u0119 szko\u0142\u0119. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "M\xF3g\u0142bym, ale to kosztuje... "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "Materialista! Jak nie chcesz pom\xF3c z dobroci serca, to poczekaj
        w jakim\u015B cichym miejscu, \u017Ceby Ci\u0119 nikt nie szuka\u0142. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4]
      value: "Mania nie da rady odwr\xF3ci\u0107 ich uwagi? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[5]
      value: "M\xF3wi, \u017Ce wykryli j\u0105, jest spalona. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[6]
      value: "Dobra tam, napisz jej, \u017Ce m\u0105dra dziewczyna jest to co\u015B
        wymy\u015Bli. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[7]
      value: "Dobra, posz\u0142o. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[8]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[9]
      value: "No tak, najpro\u015Bciej kaza\u0107 sobie radzi\u0107 samemu... Dobra,
        spr\xF3bujmy najprostszego. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: disappearanceAtQuest
      value: 57
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionSavesGame
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
