      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: appearanceAtQuest
      value: 79
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: disappearanceAtQuest
      value: 80
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionSavesGame
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.size
      value: 16
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionProgressesStory
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Zgaduj\u0119, \u017Ce to te? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[1]
      value: Tak.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[2]
      value: "Faktycznie, stare te drzwi. Co ciekawsze, drewno nie zacz\u0119\u0142o
        jeszcze butwie\u0107 pomimo tylu lat."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[3]
      value: "Wchodzimy. Stachu, rozkr\u0119cisz zamek?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[4]
      value: "Nie da rady. Sp\xF3jrz na niego, wiesz jakie to ma zapadki? Wytrych
        do takiego zamka by\u0142by wielko\u015Bci kija od szczotki.  Ale te zawiasy..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[5]
      value: "Pora na troch\u0119 testosteronu?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[6]
      value: "Tylko nie podjarajcie si\u0119 za bardzo, bo babskiej widowni nie mamy,
        a na mnie wywa\u017Cenie drzwi nie dzia\u0142a."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[7]
      value: "Ale cheerleaderk\u0105 mog\u0142aby\u015B chwil\u0119 poby\u0107."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[8]
      value: "Chyba \u015Bnisz. Mog\u0119 Was co najwy\u017Cej troch\u0119 pogoni\u0107,
        je\u015Bli to Wam pomo\u017Ce. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[9]
      value: Baby... tyle z Was pomocy.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[10]
      value: "To dlatego nigdy \u017Cadnej nie mia\u0142e\u015B?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[11]
      value: "Nie, po prostu urodzi\u0142em si\u0119 brzydki."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[12]
      value: "Dobra, wystarczy tego, wywa\u017Cmy te drzwi."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[13]
      value: Dobra, gotowi?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[14]
      value: Jazda.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[15]
      value: Raz... dwa... trzy!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[16]
      value: "Ale zobacz! Ruszy\u0142y si\u0119. Czyli plan ma sens."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[17]
      value: "Ma, trzeba tylko znale\u017A\u0107 co\u015B wi\u0119kszego i masywnego. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[18]
      value: Czyli co, teraz szukamy tarana ?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[19]
      value: "No musimy jako\u015B dosta\u0107 si\u0119 do szko\u0142y... Cholera,
        co za mr\xF3z!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[20]
      value: "Dobrze, \u017Ce mamy ten grzejnik. Telefon pokazuje mi \u201320 stopni.
        Wszystko pokryte \u015Bniegiem, b\u0119dzie ci\u0119\u017Cko co\u015B znale\u017A\u0107
        i nie odmrozi\u0107 sobie n\xF3g."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[21]
      value: "By\u0142a\u015B harcerk\u0105, jakie\u015B porady jak szuka\u0107 chrustu
        czy jak znale\u017A\u0107 taran przy szkole?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[22]
      value: "Oboz\xF3w zim\u0105 nie by\u0142o."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[23]
      value: "Szkoda, ewidentnie by si\u0119 przyda\u0142y. Teraz, gdy wi\u0119kszo\u015B\u0107
        dzieciak\xF3w zostaje wywalona ze szko\u0142y za psucie szemranych plan\xF3w
        dyrektorce, umiej\u0119tno\u015B\u0107 przetrwania w takich warunkach jest
        dla nich kluczowa!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[24]
      value: Welenc?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[25]
      value: No?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[26]
      value: "Zamknij si\u0119 i szukaj tarana."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1961759176999154892, guid: 02cd363339c020243bc8b0268a8c6cdc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: preFightLines.Array.data[27]
      value: "Zamknij si\u0119 i szukaj tarana."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
