      value: "\u017Be jest przerwa w turnieju i s\u0119dziowie chc\u0105 wyj\u015B\u0107
        z sali. Chce \u017Ceby\u015Bmy ich \u015Bledzili. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "To sam nie mo\u017Ce? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4]
      value: "Podobno pok\u0142\xF3ci\u0142 si\u0119 z nimi o jaki\u015B mecz. Troch\u0119
        podejrzane by to by\u0142o. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[5]
      value: "No dobra, pom\xF3\u017Cmy mu. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[6]
      value: "Gdyby tyle os\xF3b tak nagle zacz\u0119\u0142o chodzi\u0107 za s\u0119dziami,
        to te\u017C chyba by\u0142oby ca\u0142kiem podejrzane."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[7]
      value: "Ech... dobra pisz\u0119 do Mani... Dobra, m\xF3wi, \u017Ce spyta pani
        Lidii... Zgodzi\u0142a si\u0119! "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[8]
      value: "Szybko posz\u0142o. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[9]
      value: "Powiedzia\u0142a, \u017Ce idzie zanie\u015B\u0107 Matiemu wod\u0119.
        Tylko \u017Ce wysz\u0142a bez butelki. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: disappearanceAtQuest
      value: 57
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactionSavesGame
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[10]
      value: 'Pani Lidia po prostu nie wnika, ufa nam. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[11]
      value: 'Czy to dobrze?  '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[12]
      value: 'Pomidor. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
