    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "Panie Rogozi\u0144ski, nie\u0142adnie si\u0119 tak sp\xF3\u017Ania\u0107."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "Przepraszam, to\u015Bciara mnie zagada\u0142a."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4]
      value: "To\u015Bciara? To kto\u015B tam jeszcze chodzi? Hahaha."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[5]
      value: "Sytuacja wyj\u0105tkowa. Co tu tak gor\u0105co? Jakbym do sauny wszed\u0142."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[6]
      value: "Aaa, widzisz. Nasza szko\u0142a najwyra\u017Aniej robi si\u0119 bogata,
        bo dali mi nowe grzejniki do sali. Ciep\u0142o tu jak nigdy i to pomimo takich
        mroz\xF3w."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[7]
      value: Faktycznie, nowe. A co ze starym?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[8]
      value: "A co si\u0119 robi z niepotrzebnym grzejnikiem? Wyrzuci\u0142em go
        przez okno, hahaha. Dobra misie, przejd\u017Amy do rzeczy wa\u017Cnych. Maturzy\u015Bci,
        do komp\xF3w, reszta, do swoich zaj\u0119\u0107."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: voiceLines.Array.size
      value: 9
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: speakersIndexes.Array.size
      value: 9
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: speakersIndexes.Array.data[0]
      value: 25
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: speakersIndexes.Array.data[2]
      value: 25
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6850691048785688459, guid: 4c6fe3294fb1e724498433da51d5ffc1, type: 3}
